                    <sp:description>OTES is a Fourier-transform interferometer that collects hyperspectral thermal infrared data over the spectral range from 1750 to 100 cm–1 (5.7 to greater than 100 μm) with a spectral sampling of 8.66 cm–1 and a 6.5-mrad full-width, half-maximum (FWHM) instantaneous field of view (IFOV) in a single detector.</sp:description>
